        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "就着泡珠般的小塋来扦穴，不要做得太大，太大就会损伤龙气。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
